# Kconfig-variant check (CI "variant" build): every THERMO_* bool and PM flipped off from
# sdkconfig.defaults. Applied on top of sdkconfig.defaults; never used for release images.
# The emulator smoke job boots this image and depends on PM / light sleep staying off:
# esp32sim does not model light sleep, and a PM-on guest stalls in the PMU sleep sequence.
#   idf.py -B build-variant -DSDKCONFIG=build-variant/sdkconfig \
#          -DSDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS="sdkconfig.defaults;sdkconfig.variant" -DEPD_ROTATION=3 build
# CONFIG_THERMO_DISPLAY_FAHRENHEIT is not set
# CONFIG_THERMO_HW_WDT_ENABLE is not set
# CONFIG_PM_ENABLE is not set
